- The Big Cave - a random bigroom (with amorphous walls like the mines)
- The Sewers - orthogonal channels, some filled with water
- The Lost World - rivers, forrests, settlements deep in the dungeons
- The Random Sokoban - (which some like and others don't like)
(I experimented with the first two with quite appealing results. 8-)

